English summary

HT Lab is free for personal, non-commercial study.
You may read the site, run it locally for your own learning, share its link, and
quote short excerpts with attribution.

Without prior written permission you may NOT: modify or redistribute the content,
use it commercially, remove the copyright/brand notices, use the "HT Lab" name,
wordmark or icon for any other project, publish anything under the HT Lab name,
or use the content as training data.

The "HT Lab" name, wordmark and icon are reserved brand assets and are not covered
by the free-use permission above.

For commercial use, institutional teaching, redistribution or partnerships, please
open an issue at the repository above.
